        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Quain are delighted to offer for sale this well located site c. 0.619 acres. The site is well located just outside the village of Ballinahown, in close proximity to Clonmacnoise and only 15 minutes form Athlone. The parcel of land presents an ideal opportunity for those wishes to build in a country setting. The property is being offered for sale subject to planning permission."
      },
